    {
      "id": "claim_5df40d8a9bee4f2b89282fef8ff31e40",
      "statement": "The full gate (tools/quality/gate.sh) runs, in order: ultracite check (all), qlty check --all --no-formatters, check-types (turbo), check-types:backfill, check-types:production, check-types:performance, check-types:ci-metrics, check-types:benchmarks, check-layering, check-secrets, optionally check:manticore-bench-empty, migration-upgrade DB prep, bun test (REQUIRE_DATABASE_TESTS=1), check:production-compose-guard, and check:postgres-compose.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/quality/gate.sh#L65-L173",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f5e6d1c86f040360a5264b21c70836d979e449948a24a5b4884261ee38877d4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f5516005657d41ae8673c9fc23f9052a",
      "statement": "The gate refuses to start when `git config core.hooksPath` is set, because that means Lefthook is not installed; it tells the operator to run `bun install` / `lefthook install`.",
