      "id": "claim_06ffff035b114899a1faa27ebe0ba7f2",
      "statement": "The gate sources `.env` and tools/quality/load-compose-env.sh before running so the Claude Stop hook and bare `bun run gate` — which do not inherit a developer's interactive shell exports — see the same `POSTGRES_*` credentials Docker Compose used, instead of falling back to the ji_admin defaults; CI never has a `.env` so this is a no-op there.",
      "evidence": [
