    {
      "id": "claim_e015a4736de94ce48f3e9af258636b71",
      "statement": "A reachable Postgres makes the gate run the migration-upgrade suite against a dedicated database prepared by tools/postgres/ensure-migration-upgrade-db.ts; its result is dispatched as READY (run the suite), FAIL (a real Postgres error, never a skip, in CI or on a laptop), or SKIP (only a laptop with no Postgres running at all; in CI SKIP fails loudly). This is the RJC-395 guard: migrations 0006-0010 once passed CI with the suite silently skipped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/quality/gate.sh#L111-L155",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4d715c8b984dd9720dac7ee435b81ba89b46b02a51a78dda1f3d0414b2322cd9:"
        }
